, and benefit from our strong commitment to your wellbeing. There are so many reasons to join us. The University of Edinburgh is a world-class organisation. We are a large University covering a wide range of activities. In Professional Services, we support the University’s research and teaching, offering many career and role specialisms. The Opportunity: We are looking for an enthusiastic and experienced PMO Analyst with a willingness to get involved in all aspects of project support to join Project Services which is part of the Information Services Group (ISG). We are an established specialist team of dynamic and friendly project and programme delivery professionals supporting IT and business change at the University. Our projects include improving business efficiency, enhancing student experience, maintaining IT compliance and enabling digital transformation. Working as part of our PMO team, you will use your experience and understanding of project delivery to provide high quality PMO services to this diverse community, undertaking change management, communications and benefits management activities and supporting our project systems, processes and assurance.  Your day-to-day will be diverse, ensuring no two days are the same as you contribute to projects that make a real difference. Apply Before : 14/09/2026, 23:59 Share on social media We value your feedback on the quality of our adverts.\n            If you have a comment to make about the overall quality of this advert,\n            or its categorisation then please send us your feedback Advert information Type / Role: Subject Area(s): Location(s): Job tools Save this job Login to Save Job Max Saved Jobs Reached × Max Saved Jobs Reached A maximum of 500 Saved Jobs can be created against your account. Please remove an existing Saved Job in order to add a new Saved Job. Manage Saved Jobs × Save Job Please sign in or register for an account to save a job. Sign In Register More jobs from The University of Edinburg